{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04276","headline":"夕次旧吴 · 骆宾王","name":"夕次旧吴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"维舟背楚服，振策下吴畿。\n盛德弘三让，雄图枕九围。\n黄池通霸迹，赤壁畅戎威。\n文物俄迁谢，英灵有盛衰。\n行叹鸱夷没，遽惜湛卢飞。\n地古烟尘暗，年深馆宇稀。\n山川四望是，人事一朝非。\n悬剑空留信，亡珠尚识机。\n郑风遥可托，关月眇难依。\n西北云逾滞，东南气转微。\n徒怀伯通隐，多谢买臣归。\n唯有荒台露，薄暮湿征衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}